WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Create a daycare invoice and payment receipt with the free TuitionPing
tool. This tutorial uses fictional data.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
An invoice asks for payment.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
A receipt records money you have verified was received.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Choose Invoice. Enter your program name and optional contact details.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Add the family or account label. Replace all fictional example details
before using a real document.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Enter a document number and issue date.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Set the service period and payment due date.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Enter your charges. This example uses one monthly tuition charge of
$1,200.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Use assessed fees, approved credits, and earlier verified payments only
when applicable. Fees are not added automatically.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Click Create document. Review the family, dates, and charges.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.000
This invoice requests $1,200. It does not establish that payment was
received.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Click Print / save as PDF. Choose Save as PDF in your browser’s print
dialog, then Save.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Keep the PDF before closing the tab. Entries are not saved to your
account.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:25.000
After checking that a payment arrived, choose Receipt — a verified
payment.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Use a receipt number and the appropriate issue date. Keep the same bill
and service period.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Our fictional example records $400 received on October 6, with an
example bank-transfer reference.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:43.000
Check the verification box only after checking your payment records. A
PAID reply alone is not proof.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Create and review the receipt. It records $400 received against the
$1,200 bill.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:53.000
The remaining balance is $800. This is a partial-payment receipt.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Save the receipt as a PDF, too. Open the free tool and TuitionPing
reminder demo using the links below this video.
